  "question": {
    "text": "A box contains&nbsp;<math><mn>1</mn></math> black and <math><mn>1</mn></math> white ball. A ball is drawn randomly and replaced in the box with an additional ball of the same colour, then a second ball is drawn randomly from the box containing <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> balls. The probability that the first drawn ball was white given that at least one of the two balls drawn was white is"
  },
